# NPC architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/npc.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/npc.md).

**Permanent decision:** NPCs are MMO **characters** (ambient fill, shopkeepers,
dialogue, mission givers / talk-give-take) — **not** [mobs](../../docs/docs/architecture/mobs.md).
Ambient ~100 budget via **LOD** (not Sidekick/UAL). Motion:
probe-then-commit; no full navmesh default. Shop / mission / give-take =
**cell** outcomes. Ambient local; service NPCs interest-culled.
[Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md),
[HaloBand](../../docs/docs/architecture/haloband.md).

When changing NPC population, shops-on-NPC, dialogue, mission NPC verbs,
crowd rendering, or promoting service NPCs, read the full doc first. Also
listed in `AGENTS.md`.
